<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 2ND INNS 415-7 DEC V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 2ND INNS 415-7 DEC V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka declared their second innings at 415-7 shortly before the close on the fourth day of the second and final test on Tuesday, setting India 373 to win.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 332 and 415-7 declared, India 375.</p>
